<title>USA: Omega Financial Corp to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Omega Financial Corp to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>STATE COLLEGE, Pa. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omega Financial Corp said Friday it plans to buy back up to $10 million of common stock over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to use some of the stock to fund employee stock options and stock purchase plans.</p>
<p>&quot;Our continued strong earnings growth makes this the right time for the stock repurchase program,&quot; Chairman and Chief Executive David Lee said in a statement.</p>
<p>The stock buyback may be discontinued at any time, the company said.</p>
</text>
